OL,3,GNEWSAAstronaut surprise video leaves
OL,4,Apupils starstruck
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrimary school children have been left
OL,7,Famazed after receiving a personal video
OL,8,Fmessage from British astronaut Tim
OL,9,FPeake.
OL,11,FPupils at Thornbury Primary School in
OL,12,FPlymouth, Devon, were sent the message
OL,13,Fafter teacher Emily Trevarthen's father
OL,14,Fmet Peake while working on a cruise
OL,15,Fship over the summer.
OL,17,FTrevarthen explained that her father
OL,18,Fand the astronaut got chatting and her
OL,19,Ffather mentioned she was a teacher. "We
OL,20,Fdidn't expect to get what we got
OL,21,Freally," she said.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
