OL,3,GNEWSAAstronaut surprise video leaves
OL,4,Apupils starstruck
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeake told pupils: "I hear you've been
OL,7,Fstudying all about space, a subject
OL,8,Fvery close to my heart, something I
OL,9,Flove, so I'm very pleased that you
OL,10,Fenjoy it too. Stay curious. Keep
OL,11,Flooking up at the stars."
